Package: gumicord
Version: {{VERSION}}
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: gumicord <https://github.com/gumicord/gumicord>
Depends: libdbus-1-3, libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1
Description: Third-party Discord client
 Gumicord is a third-party Discord client written in Rust with a custom
 renderer (wgpu). It supports QR code login, multiple accounts, themes,
 and plugins.
 .
 WARNING: Connecting to Discord with a third-party client breaks their
 Terms of Service and can cost you your account.
Homepage: https://github.com/gumicord/gumicord
